# Rename this file to guests-endpoint.txt to enable the guest cast.
#
# One https:// URL, returning the roster manifest described in the README.
# Without this file, GUEST_ENDPOINT is empty and the wallpaper never makes a
# network request of any kind.
#
# http://localhost:PORT is accepted for local testing only, and the build
# prints a warning so a dev build is never shipped by accident.

https://api.example.com/arena/roster.json
